  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;CHRISTIE'S&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Christie's is a prestigious auction house that hosted a notable auction event in 2018 featuring rare and valuable items, including a piece of artwork titled 'Ephemeral' encased in polyamide film laminate."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0148</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEW YORK CITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"New York City is the location where Christie's auction house is situated, hosting the notable auction event."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0148</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARIA RODRIGUEZ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Maria Rodriguez is a renowned artist who created the artwork 'Ephemeral,' which was encased in a specially designed polyamide film laminate during the notable auction event."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0148</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POLYAMIDE FILM LAMINATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Polyamide film laminate is a versatile material used in various industrial applications, including packaging, textiles, and construction, known for its high strength, flexibility, and resistance to moisture."&lt;SEP&gt;"Polyamide film laminate is the product at the center of the legal dispute, indicating its significance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0148</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;US PATENT 11351763&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"US patent 11351763 is a patent detailing the use of polyamide film laminate in a novel application, central to the legal maelstrom involving the patent."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0148</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ARTFORUM MAGAZINE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Artforum magazine is a publication that featured an interview with Maria Rodriguez, praising the polyamide film laminate used in her artwork 'Ephemeral.'"</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0148</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOURNAL OF MATERIALS SCIENCE AND ENGINEERING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Journal of Materials Science and Engineering is a scientific journal that published a study analyzing the properties of polyamide film laminate and its applications in the art conservation industry."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0148</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF AUCTION THEORY AND PRACTICE&quot;">
