    <node id="&quot;USPTO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"USPTO is the United States Patent and Trademark Office, where a patent for polyamide film laminate was filed and later became the subject of a legal dispute."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0148</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RIVAL COMPANY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A rival company, a major player in the industry, filed a complaint with the USPTO alleging that the patent for polyamide film laminate was invalid and that the inventors had not disclosed all necessary information."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rival company is pursuing legal action against 'This company' and is seen as having a competitive advantage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0148</data>
    </node>
